      "en": "Do not share language list with websites"
    },
    "description": {
      "de": "Webseiten erfahren nicht mehr, welche Sprachen du in Windows installiert hast. Das erschwert Fingerprinting.",
      "en": "Websites no longer learn which languages you have installed in Windows. This makes fingerprinting harder."
